msgstr "Απομακρύνετε την άδεια σας από αυτό το αντίγραφο του NVDA"

msgid "Select a language, and then configure the voice to be used:"
msgstr ""
"Επιλέξτε μία τοπική γλώσσα, και κατόπιν διαμορφώστε τη φωνή που θα "
"χρησιμοποιηθεί:"

msgid "Success!"
msgstr "Επιτυχία!"

msgid "The license file exists but could not be read."
msgstr ""

msgid "The license file was copied, but its data could not be read."
msgstr ""

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Use your own Vocalizer license file. The selected file will be copied to "
"your NVDA configuration.\n"
"\n"
"The Automotive engine will check the license after NVDA is restarted. Due to "
"limitations of communication between 64-bit NVDA and the 32-bit host, a "
"detailed reason for rejecting the license may not be displayed. If the "
"engine rejects the license, the synthesizer may simply fail to load.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""

